Critter size comes into play when affecting your alignment to your god.
The only thing that affect whether or not an alter converts is your experience
level.

For fun, sacrifice a human while being a demon.  Or sacrifice something that
the game knows you stole from a shop.  Or pray while a lawful undead.  Or as 
a lawful or neutral demon.

